    "summary.md": "# Habit Board\n\nSee daily habits and how many are done at a glance.\n\n- **Target user:** People building daily habits\n- **Build route:** compile\n- **Genome:** dashboard\n- **Persistence:** browser-local storage\n- **Start:** `npm run dev` → http://localhost:3000\n\n## Verified journeys\n\n- Application loads and shows a useful empty state\n- Invalid habit input shows validation without crashing\n- User can add a complete habit and see it in habits\n- habits survive a page refresh\n- User can edit an existing habit\n- User can narrow habits with a meaningful filter\n- habits are grouped by a meaningful category or status\n- Requested derived values update from persisted records\n- User can delete an existing habit\n"
  },
